# v1.0.0 R2 — committed contract goldens (the SemVer freeze fixtures)
# must escape the blanket tests/fixtures/* ignore. Everything else under
# tests/fixtures stays out (session-generated mp4s, scratch dirs).
!tests/fixtures/contracts/

